            {
              "text": "UDR の次ホップ（仮想アプライアンス）で、アプライアンスのプライベート IP へ誘導する",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/virtual-network/virtual-network-routing-appliance-overview", "locator": "概要", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-28T23:25:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "帯域は 10 / 50 / 100 / 200 Gbps から選択。IPv4・IPv6・デュアルスタック対応",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/virtual-network/virtual-network-routing-appliance-overview", "locator": "メリット", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-28T23:25:00Z" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "how-to-start", "heading": "設定の流れ（Azure portal）", "availability": "present", "priority": "core",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "VNet に VirtualNetworkApplianceSubnet を作成する",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/virtual-network/how-to-create-virtual-network-routing-appliance", "locator": "仮想ネットワークの作成", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-28T23:25:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "ポータルでルーティング アプライアンスを検索 → [作成] → リージョン・容量・VNet を指定",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/virtual-network/how-to-create-virtual-network-routing-appliance", "locator": "ルーティング アプライアンスを作成する", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-28T23:25:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "[メトリクス] で送受信バイト・パケット・フロー数を確認（診断設定は不要）",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/virtual-network/how-to-create-virtual-network-routing-appliance", "locator": "ルーティングアプライアンスを監視する", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-28T23:25:00Z" }]
            }
